<item><title>Standard Bank of Angola courts Chinese firms with financing pitch in Luanda</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/ao/standard-bank-of-angola-courts-chinese-firms-with-financing-f364a1/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/ao/standard-bank-of-angola-courts-chinese-firms-with-financing-f364a1/</guid><category>Angola</category><description>At a China Day event in Luanda, the bank brought clients and partners together to discuss funding options and Angola&apos;s economic conditions.</description><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 08:10:52 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/ao.jpg" length="32597" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/ao.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Angola says antiretroviral supplies are arriving despite funding cuts</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/ao/angola-says-antiretroviral-supplies-are-arriving-despite-73e62f/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/ao/angola-says-antiretroviral-supplies-are-arriving-despite-73e62f/</guid><category>Angola</category><description>The national AIDS institute says a public tender is bringing in medicines, while community programmes have been hit hardest by reduced external support.</description><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 18:33:36 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/ao/angola-says-antiretroviral-supplies-are-arriving-despite-73e62f/share.jpg" length="43547" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/ao/angola-says-antiretroviral-supplies-are-arriving-despite-73e62f/share.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Angolan farmers learn moringa oil processing as Dutch agronomist eyes Huambo factories</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/ao/angolan-farmers-learn-moringa-oil-processing-as-dutch-2e8477/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/ao/angolan-farmers-learn-moringa-oil-processing-as-dutch-2e8477/</guid><category>Angola</category><description>A training course covered everything from seed selection and leaf treatment to pressing, certification and international buyers for the plant&apos;s oil.</description><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 17:04:55 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/ao.jpg" length="32597" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/ao.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Angola&apos;s flag carrier opens 226-seat lounge at Luanda&apos;s new airport</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/ao/angola-s-flag-carrier-opens-226-seat-lounge-at-luanda-s-new-85b386/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/ao/angola-s-flag-carrier-opens-226-seat-lounge-at-luanda-s-new-85b386/</guid><category>Angola</category><description>The 1,600-square-metre Kalandula lounge is the national airline&apos;s third at the airport, where 29% of its passengers were in transit in the first half of 2026.</description><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 12:12:58 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/ao.jpg" length="32597" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/ao.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
